{
    "title": "Mobolist: Mobile Specs, Prices",
    "description": "- Mobolist is a global application where you can find out the latest mobile phones and their specifications in Arab countries and around the world from all manufacturers with the prices according to the local currency of each country. Also, it contains many useful categories that help you choose the right phone.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Phones Prices\r\nMobolist App provides prices of mobile phones in several Arab countries, including mobile prices in Syria, mobile prices in Lebanon, mobile prices in Iraq, mobile prices in Jordan, mobile prices in Egypt, mobile prices in the UAE, mobile prices in Saudi Arabia, mobile prices in Algeria, mobile prices in Kuwait, mobile prices in Bahrain, mobile prices in Qatar, mobile prices in Oman, mobile prices in Tunisia, mobile prices in Morocco in addition to worldwide costs.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Tablets Prices and Tab Specifications\r\nMobolist app displays the most recent tablet devices and full tablet specifications which are available in each country with tablets prices in the market according to the local currency from all brands such as Samsung tablets, Huawei tablets, Honor tablets, Apple iPad, Xiaomi Pad, Nokia Tabs, Lenovo Tabs, OnePlus Pad, Oppo Pad, Realme Pad, Vivo Pad and others.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Top and Best Phones\r\nMobolist app contains best phones according to each category, including Top Premium Flagship Phones, Best Mid-Range Budget Phones, Best Affordable Phones, Best Battery Life Phones, Top Fastest-Charging Phones, Top Camera Phones, Top Selfie Phones, Top Phones for Games, Top Foldable Phones, Best mobile performance according to AnTuTu Benchmark, Best DXOMARK Main Camera and Selfie Camera, GeekBench Best CPU Performance Phones, GSMArena Trending Phones.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Smart Search\r\nMobolist has the advantage of smart search for any phone where all you have to do is start typing the name of the device and then choose the phone you are looking for to see the full specifications with the price in your country from all major companies such as Samsung, Huawei, Oppo, Xiaomi, Apple, Honor, HTC, Nokia, Sony Xperia, Google Pixel, Lenovo, Realme, Vivo, ZTE, Meizu, Motorola, ASUS, Infinix, Tecno, Nothing Phone, and OnePlus.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Full Phone Specifications\r\nMobolist includes the most important mobile specifications you need with detailed information about each device such as screen size, main camera resolution, RAM, CPU phone processor, selfie camera resolution, operating system, battery capacity, fast charging, internal capacity, colors, sound, sensors, fingerprint, and others as well as a photo collection of the device.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Filters\r\nMobolist offers you the option of finding the right phone for you by several filters or categories such as screen size, RAM, rear camera, processor, brand, or company as well as the price filter or you can choose several filters at one time through the advanced search option, which gives you wider options to select the appropriate phone or mobile that you are looking for.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Full Comparison\r\nWith Mobolist App, the comparison is made more accessible, you can compare phones from any company or brand easily, and with a press of a button, just select the first phone via the search box then choose the second one and see the specifications comparison to know which one is the best phone.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Favorite Phones\r\nWith Mobolist App you can add any device or devices you want to your favorite list for reference at any time or to follow the price easily and quickly.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Notifications\r\nYou can subscribe to notifications to receive updates about the latest phones and prices to keep you up to date.\r\n\r\n\u2022 All you have to do is, download Mobolist app and choose your country then you will find a full list of the latest phone prices and specifications that are available.\r\n\r\n\u2022 If you have any suggestion or feature you would like to be added to the application, or you are experiencing a problem while using the application, please feel free to share complaints and feedback through the contact page within the application.",
    "descriptionHTML": "- Mobolist is a global application where you can find out the latest mobile phones and their specifications in Arab countries and around the world from all manufacturers with the prices according to the local currency of each country. Also, it contains many useful categories that help you choose the right phone.<br><br>\u2022 Phones Prices<br>Mobolist App provides prices of mobile phones in several Arab countries, including mobile prices in Syria, mobile prices in Lebanon, mobile prices in Iraq, mobile prices in Jordan, mobile prices in Egypt, mobile prices in the UAE, mobile prices in Saudi Arabia, mobile prices in Algeria, mobile prices in Kuwait, mobile prices in Bahrain, mobile prices in Qatar, mobile prices in Oman, mobile prices in Tunisia, mobile prices in Morocco in addition to worldwide costs.<br><br>\u2022 Tablets Prices and Tab Specifications<br>Mobolist app displays the most recent tablet devices and full tablet specifications which are available in each country with tablets prices in the market according to the local currency from all brands such as Samsung tablets, Huawei tablets, Honor tablets, Apple iPad, Xiaomi Pad, Nokia Tabs, Lenovo Tabs, OnePlus Pad, Oppo Pad, Realme Pad, Vivo Pad and others.<br><br>\u2022 Top and Best Phones<br>Mobolist app contains best phones according to each category, including Top Premium Flagship Phones, Best Mid-Range Budget Phones, Best Affordable Phones, Best Battery Life Phones, Top Fastest-Charging Phones, Top Camera Phones, Top Selfie Phones, Top Phones for Games, Top Foldable Phones, Best mobile performance according to AnTuTu Benchmark, Best DXOMARK Main Camera and Selfie Camera, GeekBench Best CPU Performance Phones, GSMArena Trending Phones.<br><br>\u2022 Smart Search<br>Mobolist has the advantage of smart search for any phone where all you have to do is start typing the name of the device and then choose the phone you are looking for to see the full specifications with the price in your country from all major companies such as Samsung, Huawei, Oppo, Xiaomi, Apple, Honor, HTC, Nokia, Sony Xperia, Google Pixel, Lenovo, Realme, Vivo, ZTE, Meizu, Motorola, ASUS, Infinix, Tecno, Nothing Phone, and OnePlus.<br><br>\u2022 Full Phone Specifications<br>Mobolist includes the most important mobile specifications you need with detailed information about each device such as screen size, main camera resolution, RAM, CPU phone processor, selfie camera resolution, operating system, battery capacity, fast charging, internal capacity, colors, sound, sensors, fingerprint, and others as well as a photo collection of the device.<br><br>\u2022 Filters<br>Mobolist offers you the option of finding the right phone for you by several filters or categories such as screen size, RAM, rear camera, processor, brand, or company as well as the price filter or you can choose several filters at one time through the advanced search option, which gives you wider options to select the appropriate phone or mobile that you are looking for.<br><br>\u2022 Full Comparison<br>With Mobolist App, the comparison is made more accessible, you can compare phones from any company or brand easily, and with a press of a button, just select the first phone via the search box then choose the second one and see the specifications comparison to know which one is the best phone.<br><br>\u2022 Favorite Phones<br>With Mobolist App you can add any device or devices you want to your favorite list for reference at any time or to follow the price easily and quickly.<br><br>\u2022 Notifications<br>You can subscribe to notifications to receive updates about the latest phones and prices to keep you up to date.<br><br>\u2022 All you have to do is, download Mobolist app and choose your country then you will find a full list of the latest phone prices and specifications that are available.<br><br>\u2022 If you have any suggestion or feature you would like to be added to the application, or you are experiencing a problem while using the application, please feel free to share complaints and feedback through the contact page within the application.",
